able"},"VAI":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"VAI_PSM":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"XVS_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"}},"title":"TreasuryTokenBuybackDistributor","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"OnlySelf()":[{"notice":"Thrown when `_convertVaiViaPsm` is called by anyone other than this contract"}],"WeightsMisconfigured(uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the configured weights do not sum to MAX_BPS"}],"ZeroAddressNotAllowed()":[{"notice":"Thrown if the supplied address is a zero address where it is not allowed"}]},"events":{"TokenDistributed(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted once per token after it has been fully distributed"},"VaiConvertedViaPsm(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted after VAI has been redeemed for the PSM stable token and sent to the treasury"}},"kind":"user","methods":{"BTCB_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"BTCB Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"BTCB_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the BTCB buyback (15%)"},"ETH_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"ETH Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"ETH_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the ETH buyback (15%)"},"MAX_BPS()":{"notice":"Denominator for the weight basis points. Also the PSM's own basis-points divisor."},"STABLE_TOKEN()":{"notice":"The PSM's stable token (USDT). Output of `convertVaiViaPsm`; delivered directly to         the treasury (USDT needs no buyback conversion)."},"TREASURY()":{"notice":"The Venus treasury (VTreasury). Receives the USDT redeemed from VAI at the PSM,         since USDT is already a base asset and needs no buyback conversion."},"USDC_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"USDC Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"USDC_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the USDC buyback (15%)"},"USDT_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"USDT Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"USDT_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the USDT buyback (15%)"},"U_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"U Treasury TokenBuyback contract (receives the remainder leg)"},"U_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the U buyback (30%). The U buyback receives the         re-read remaining balance rather than a computed share, so it also absorbs the         integer-division dust from the five weighted legs above."},"VAI()":{"notice":"VAI token. Converted to USDT via the PSM before distribution rather than         DEX-swapped out of its thin market by the buybacks."},"VAI_PSM()":{"notice":"VAI Peg Stability Module (PegStability_USDT). Redeems VAI for its stable token         (USDT) at the oracle-pegged rate minus the PSM's outgoing fee."},"XVS_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"XVS Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"XVS_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the XVS buyback (10%)"},"_convertVaiViaPsm()":{"notice":"Internal implementation of the VAI→USDT redemption, exposed as an external         function only so `convertVaiViaPsm` can wrap it in try/catch. Restricted to self."},"convertVaiViaPsm()":{"notice":"Redeems the contract's entire VAI balance for the PSM stable token (USDT) at the         VAI Peg Stability Module and delivers the USDT straight back to the treasury,         instead of DEX-swapping VAI out of the thin VAI market. USDT is already a base         asset, so it needs no buyback conversion — the redemption just turns the treasury's         illiquid VAI into treasury-held USDT at the peg (minus the small PSM fee)."},"distribute(address[])":{"notice":"Splits the contract's live balance of each supplied token across the six         Treasury buybacks by the fixed weights. Tokens with a zero balance are skipped."}},"notice":"One-shot helper used by the "Venus Treasury Cleanup" VIP. Governance withdraws         miscellaneous treasury tokens into this contract and then calls `distribute`,         which splits each token's *live* balance across the six Treasury `TokenBuyback`         contracts by a fixed weight. Because the split is computed from `balanceOf(this)`         at e